ctions\">Collections</a>\n<a class=\"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant dark:text-on-secondary-fixed-variant hover:text-tertiary dark:hover:text-tertiary-fixed-dim transition-colors duration-300 uppercase\" href=\"/process\">Process</a>\n<a class=\"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant dark:text-on-secondary-fixed-variant hover:text-tertiary dark:hover:text-tertiary-fixed-dim transition-colors duration-300 uppercase\" href=\"/inquiry\">Inquiry</a>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"md:hidden\">\n<button class=\"text-on-surface\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-2xl\">menu</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<a class=\"font-display-lg text-body-lg tracking-widest uppercase text-primary dark:text-on-primary-fixed\" href=\"/\">Vale &amp; Vellum</a>\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n<button aria-label=\"Shopping Bag\" class=\"text-on-surface hover:text-tertiary transition-colors duration-300\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\" data-icon=\"shopping_bag\">shopping_bag</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</header>\n<main class=\"pt-[100px]\">\n<!-- Hero Section -->\n<section class=\"relative w-full h-[85vh] min-h-[600px] flex items-center justify-center px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-container-max mx-auto\">\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 px-4 md:px-0 pt-4 pb-12\">\n<div class=\"w-full h-full relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-container-low border border-outline-variant/30\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-90 mix-blend-multiply\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAV0VlYQcP2DIfYYu1sS2k92w2M3Vb63zAUUhBH5M3kygxcq9gLO5O56niJqiQHywAwN9qXjjEfLq8_7QsWSCDqYBlEaSAAugj3rsQhI3c49znl5hVu7vCCCJeQQzuJ4I1BwXAFar-bTINVNz3xZeH0zYkmSL1dgLFK5OxJQdX00IMzNJDmYVleMquTrJcL1kMNT9xhfXVBH-uEu_vAvv3ZnMOKYZ8pteoE6PI9bhoVsYbJ8X4vhHepk7r7__De_2V7tLzpKXqo1E-e\"/>\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-surface/80 via-transparent to-surface/30\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"relative z-10 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 mt-24\">\n<h1 class=\"font-display-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-display-lg text-primary mb-8 leading-tight\">A quieter standard of luxury, made visible.</h1>\n<p class=\"font-body-lg text-body-md md:text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-12 max-w-xl mx-auto font-light tracking-wide\">Boutique stationery and custom invitation suites for private clients who notice the difference.</p>\n<a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-caps text-label-caps px-8 py-4 uppercase tracking-[0.15em] hover:bg-[#8b7355] transition-colors duration-500 letterpress\" href=\"/inquiry\">\n                    Request Concierge Access\n                </a>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Provenance Section -->\n<section class=\"py-section-gap px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-container-max mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-center\">\n<div class=\"md:col-span-5 md:col-start-2 order-2 md:order-1\">\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-primary mb-8\">The Art of the Impression.</h2>\n<div class=\"space-y-6 text-on-surface-variant font-body-md\">\n<p>We believe in the tactile weight of a communication unhurried by digital convenience. Our process is rooted in historic craftsmanship, utilizing antique letterpress machinery to physically deboss your narrative into heavy, pure cotton stock.</p>\n<p>Every suite is an exercise in restraint and precision. From the initial sourcing of archival materials to the hand-finished assembly involving silk ribbons and custom wax seals, the result is a physical artifact intended to endure.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-10\">\n<a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-label-caps text-label-caps text-primary uppercase border-b border-primary pb-1 hover:text-on-tertiary-container hover:border-on-tertiary-container transition-colors\" href=\"/process\">\n                   