iv>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<div>\n<h3 class=\"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-primary uppercase mb-2\">Bespoke Editorial</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-sm text-on-surface-variant\">One-of-a-kind commissions</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-outline-variant group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">east</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Minimalist Process -->\n<section class=\"py-section-gap px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-container-max mx-auto bg-surface-container-lowest\">\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter\">\n<div class=\"md:col-span-4\">\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-primary mb-6\">The Journey</h2>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-sm\">A meticulously managed timeline from initial concept to the moment your guests break the seal.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6\">\n<ul class=\"space-y-0\">\n<li class=\"py-6 border-b border-outline-variant/20 flex items-baseline gap-6\">\n<span class=\"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-outline\">01</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-lg text-body-lg text-primary tracking-wide\">Consultation</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"py-6 border-b border-outline-variant/20 flex items-baseline gap-6\">\n<span class=\"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-outline\">02</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-lg text-body-lg text-primary tracking-wide\">Material Direction</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"py-6 border-b border-outline-variant/20 flex items-baseline gap-6\">\n<span class=\"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-outline\">03</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-lg text-body-lg text-primary tracking-wide\">Proofing</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"py-6 border-b border-outline-variant/20 flex items-baseline gap-6\">\n<span class=\"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-outline\">04</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-lg text-body-lg text-primary tracking-wide\">Production</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"py-6 border-b border-outline-variant/20 flex items-baseline gap-6\">\n<span class=\"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-outline\">05</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-lg text-body-lg text-primary tracking-wide text-[#8b7355] italic font-serif\">Concierge Delivery</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Trust / Timeline -->\n<section class=\"py-section-gap px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-container-max mx-auto\">\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-center\">\n<div class=\"md:col-span-6 pr-0 md:pr-12\">\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant/20 p-3 bg-surface\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuD-7gpaZMoGww6qeh73wa5_YqLx8AtwSRkJt1CbYKNfvCkF7t-366xfKlTQbKug8qa_0dl1HcOcI3_Fl9jlLfmIo3ndwCNmDqB0_6AoMoU9_94YZsF4wKtkcY8q7LFhUufGc5je_8P9EDkT-TgbUMtfrLSDFP90x-EO1oKBgzJoBAPtLdXsE-8MAK7trPvWn60hhf-NTVkqucoP_1NNbaMMae34KW6i4hksQa8BDXD8n7XCSw3WLsxPRn1yoAcl1-2ReHNBX_eQ9HSD\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"md:col-span-5 md:col-start-8 mt-12 md:mt-0\">\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-lg text-3xl text-primary mb-6\">Timeline &amp; Delivery</h3>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6\">Standard production requires 8-12 weeks for custom suites to allow for meticulous typesetting, plate creation, and hand-assembly.</p>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-8\">Rush options are considered for private events based on studio capacity. Sample kits showcasing our archival stock and impression depth are available upon request.</p>\n<div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm px-3 py-1 border border-outline-variant/40 bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant rounded-sm letterpress\">Hand-deckled</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm px-3 py-1 border border-outline-variant/40 bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant rounded-sm letterpress\">110lb Cotton</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm px-3 py-1 border border-outline-variant/40 bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface-variant rounded-sm letterpress\">Blind Deboss</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Inquiry Form Area -->\n<section class=\"py-section-gap px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-container-max mx-auto bg-surface-container-low border-t border-b border-outline-variant/20 my-12\">\n<div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16\">\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-primary mb-4\">Secure Your Date</h2>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-on-surface-variant\">We accept a limited number of commissions each season to ensure uncompromising quality.</p>\n</div>\n<form class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-12\">\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12\">\n<div class=\"relative\">\n<label class=\"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant block mb-2 uppercase\" for=\"event_date\">Event Date</label>\n<input class=\"w-full bg-transparent border-0 border-b border-outline focus:ring-0 focus:border-primary px-0 py-2 font-body-md text-primary placeholder:text-outline-variant transition-colors\" id=\"event_date\" placeholder=\"MM / YYYY\" type=\"text\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"relative\">\n<label class=\"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant block mb-2 uppercase\" for=\"guest_count\">Est. Guest Count</label>\n<input class=\"w-full bg-transparent border-0 border-b border-outline focus:ring-0 focus:border-primary px-0 py-2 font-body-md text-primary placeholder:text-outline-variant transition-colors\" id=\"guest_count\" placeholder=\"e.g., 150\" type=\"text\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"relative\">\n<label class=\"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant block mb-6 uppercase\">Package Path</label>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n<label class=\"flex items-center p-4 border border-outline-variant/50 cursor-pointer hover:border-primary transition-colors bg-surface group\">\n<input class=\"form-radio text-primary border-outline focus:ring-primary h-4 w-4\" name=\"package\" type=\"radio\"/>\n<div class=\"ml-4\">\n<span class=\"block font-label-caps text-label-caps text-primary uppercase mb-1\">Signature Suite</span>\n<span class=\"block font-body-md text-xs text-on-surface-variant group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Curated designs</span>\n</div>\n</label>\n<label class=\"flex items-center p-4 border border-outline-variant/50 cursor-pointer hover:border-primary transition-colors bg-surface group\">\n<input class=\"form-radio text-primary border-outline focus:ring-primary h-4 w-4\" name=\"package\" type=\"radio\"/>\n<div class=\"ml-4\">\n<span class=\"block font-label-caps text-label-caps text-primary uppercase mb-1\">Bespoke</span>\n<span class=\"block font-body-md text-xs text-on-surface-variant group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Fully custom commission</span>\n</div>\n</label>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"text-center pt-8\">\n<button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-caps text-label-caps px-12 py-4 uppercase tracking-[0.15em] hover:bg-[#8b7355] transition-colors duration-500 letterpress w-full md:w-auto\" type=\"button\">\n                        Begin Inquiry\n                    </button>\n</div>\n</form>\n</section>\n</main>\n<!-- Footer -->\n<footer class=\"bg-surface-container dark:bg-surface-container-highest text-on-surface dark:text-on-surface-variant full-width border-t border-outline-variant/50 dark:border-outline/30 flat no shadows w-full px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-section-gap grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter max-w-container-max mx-auto\">\n<div class=\"md:col-span-4 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n<div class=\"mb-12 md:mb-0\">\n<a class=\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-primary dark:text-on-primary-fixed block mb-4\" href=\"/\">Vale &amp; Vellum</a>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-xs\">Crafting tangible permanence for significant moments.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant tracking-widest uppercase\">\u00a9 2024 Vale &amp; Vellum Studio. All Rights Reserved.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"md:col-span-2 md:col-start-7 mb-8 md:mb-0\">\n<h4 class=\"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-primary uppercase mb-6 tracking-widest\">Studio</h4>\n<ul class=\"space-y-4 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-secondary-container dark:text-on-secondary-fixed-variant\">\n<li><a class=\"hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-on-primary-fixed transition-all hover:underline underline-offset-4\" href=\"#\">Studio Location</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-on-primary-fixed transition-all hover:underline underline-offset-4\" href=\"#\">Contact</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-on-primary-fixed transition-all hover:underline underline-offset-4\" href=\"#\">Journal</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"hover:text-primary dark:hover:text-on-primary-fixed transition-all hover:underline underline-offset-4\" href=\"#\">Privacy</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"md:col-span-4 md:col-start-9\">\n<h4 class=\"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-primary uppercase mb-6 tracking-widest\">Studio Notes</h4>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-secondary-container dark:text-on-secondary-fixed-variant mb-6\">Occasional dispatches on paper craft, etiquette, and new archive releases.</p>\n<form class=\"relative flex\">\n<input class=\"w-full bg-transparent border-0 border-b border-outline-variant focus:ring-0 focus:border-primary px-0 py-2 font-body-md text-primary placeholder:text-outline-variant transition-colors rounded-none\" placeholder=\"Email Address\" type=\"email\"/>\n<button class=\"absolute right-0 bottom-2 text-primary hover:text-[#8b7355] transition-colors\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">east</span>\n</button>\n</form>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</body></html>",
